<?php $pageTitle='Plan your visit'; $activeNav='contact'; require __DIR__.'/partials/header.php'; ?><main id="main"><header class="shell page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">A little help along the way</p><h1>Let’s plan your stay.</h1><p>Find a room, revisit a reservation, or get a little more familiar with your next destination.</p></header><section class="shell contact-grid"><article class="contact-card"><?= ns_icon('calendar') ?><h2>A new reservation</h2><p>Start with your dates and guest count. Explore available rooms before making your reservation.</p><a class="text-link" href="/rooms">Find a room <?= ns_icon('arrow') ?></a></article><article class="contact-card"><?= ns_icon('user') ?><h2>Your existing stay</h2><p>Reservations made while signed in are saved in your account, with dates and current status.</p><a class="text-link" href="/my-bookings">My reservations <?= ns_icon('arrow') ?></a></article><article class="contact-card"><?= ns_icon('pin') ?><h2>Discover Pokhara</h2><p>Get to know the destination and start planning the places you would like to explore.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Pokhara%2C+Nepal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore the area <?= ns_icon('arrow') ?></a></article></section><section class="shell section faq-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Before you arrive</p><h2>A few things<br>you may be wondering.</h2><p class="lead">A simpler start to your time away.</p></div><div class="faq-list"><details open><summary>How do I reserve a room?</summary><p>Choose your dates and guest count on the rooms page. Select a room, enter your contact details, and submit your reservation. The receipt shows its current status.</p></details><details><summary>What does “Pending” mean?</summary><p>Your reservation has been recorded and is awaiting confirmation. Pending does not mean payment has been received or your stay is confirmed.</p></details><details><summary>Do I need an account to book?</summary><p>You can submit a reservation as a guest. Sign in before booking if you want it saved in your account history. Guest bookings do not automatically appear in a new account.</p></details><details><summary>Where can I find my booking details?</summary><p>Save or print the receipt after submitting your reservation. If you booked while signed in, open My reservations from your account.</p></details></div></section></main><?php require __DIR__.'/partials/footer.php'; ?>